+
+This is a REPORT, per R-1: marks are a report to Frank-Rene, not an
+action. Nothing has been sorted, nothing migrated, no fork closed.
+
+The question asked was: are the discussions terminated, and can the
+results be migrated into the RATIONALE files. The short answer is that
+MOST RESULTS ARE ALREADY THERE -- 65 of the 67 labels cited across the
+40 gathered files are already entries in a RATIONALE file -- so a
+migration as such would mostly DUPLICATE what stands. What the gathered
+files hold, beyond those entries, is residue: what was built, what is
+owed, and what is still open. The sorting rule already covers that
+case ('todo-N, DONE lists -> deleted'), but three defects in the
+RATIONALE substrate itself stand in the way and are reported below.
+
+______________________________________________________________________________
+
+1  TERMINATION STATUS, ALL 40 FILES
+
+TERMINATED -- nothing open, nothing owed                            (11)
+
+    03  scratch-leaks-into-tmp        CLOSED; E-27, R-76 recorded
+    06  pype-is-part-of-the-oracle    ruled, nothing to build
+    0i  wish-names-directories        SETTLED; E-18, E-20, E-21
+    0l  hwut-play                     SETTLED; four forks ruled AND built
+    0q  face-inventory                a MEASUREMENT, not a discussion
+    0y  instantiation-blessing        decided AND built
+    10  caps-vocabulary               decided AND built
+    11  directory-keys-rebuilt        decided AND built
+    12  parser-relocation             decided AND built
+    15  same-and-interactive          decided AND built
+    0a  caps-per-choice               facts measured; ruled into O-20/O-21
+
+DECIDED, NOT (FULLY) BUILT -- the ruling stands, labour is owed       (14)
+
+    04  judgement-timing              decided; rests on R-70 (see 2.1)
+    05  tree-model                    decided, parked behind a trigger
+    08  dispatcher-to-operations      seam built, implementation owed
+    0b  run-face                      labour owed
+    0c  placement-backend             decided, not built (O-13 seam)
